1
00:00:23,712 --> 00:00:28,451
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,451 --> 00:00:32,163
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,387 --> 00:00:34,632
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:34,979 --> 00:00:37,686
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,565 --> 00:00:43,093
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,093 --> 00:00:46,725
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,203 --> 00:00:50,691
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,835 --> 00:00:55,331
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,331 --> 00:00:59,971
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:02,019
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,019 --> 00:01:07,971
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,163 --> 00:01:11,851
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,851 --> 00:01:15,422
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,587 --> 00:01:22,531
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:22,979 --> 00:01:26,600
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:30,284
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,371 --> 00:01:35,299
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,299 --> 00:01:39,459
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,203 --> 00:01:46,755
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,299 --> 00:01:49,955
=Episode 21=

21
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:53,400
Governor,

22
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:56,560
should we send someone to confirm
whether Xu You'an is really dead?

23
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:59,280
No need. Seeing is believing.

24
00:02:00,239 --> 00:02:03,159
The most important thing now
is to get the Buddha Head

25
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:05,239
and complete the arms deal.

26
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:13,319
Then, whether it's Rong Xiaonan
or the Xiaosheng Society,

27
00:02:14,879 --> 00:02:16,759
I won't spare either of them.

28
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:23,719
The place in the photo should be here.

29
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,120
The Jade Buddha Head is indeed here.

30
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,360
Don't move!

31
00:03:11,879 --> 00:03:12,680
Don't move!

32
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,080
Slow down.

33
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,960
Look at this lousy place you picked.

34
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,719
These branches and rocks are killing me.

35
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:51,800
Governor Xu,

36
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:55,039
can you show me the manliness you had
when you hit me yesterday?

37
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:59,840
I originally thought
you were highly skilled in martial arts.

38
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:06,240
I didn't expect
that you'd also be a paper tiger.

39
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,879
Without me, the paper tiger,

40
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:18,199
you couldn't have put on this show.

41
00:04:20,064 --> 00:04:22,480
(Spirit Tablet
of Revered Master Rong Huaiqiu)

42
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:25,920
Master, this time
I won't run away again.

43
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,480
This time I will accomplish

44
00:04:29,639 --> 00:04:33,879
the revenge I haven't taken before
at any cost.

45
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:48,519
Rong Xiaonan!

46
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:50,839
Die!

47
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,160
Sorry.

48
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:18,839
I cannot escape blame
for Adjutant Sun's death.

49
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,160
Can an apology
bring Yongnian back to life?

50
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:30,680
Why would you be the one to betray us?

51
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:33,839
Why does it have to be you?

52
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:47,160
I pretended to surrender to save you.

53
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,879
Will you believe me?

54
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:55,759
But I saw Yongnian die in front of me
with my own eyes.

55
00:05:56,360 --> 00:06:01,040
I saw you lead men to dig up Head Rong
and Gu Fengqiu's memorial tomb.

56
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,800
I saw you hand over
the phoenix crown to Du Xiaolin.

57
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,319
Do you still want to deceive me?

58
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,879
Xu Fan has retaken Governor Mansion.

59
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,160
You've been hunted.

60
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:14,920
We are weak,

61
00:06:15,839 --> 00:06:17,480
and nothing can be done.

62
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:22,160
Right now, our priority
is to get you out.

63
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:25,279
Get me out for what?

64
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,600
To run for my life?

65
00:06:30,319 --> 00:06:33,199
After you get out,
first find the real Buddha Head.

66
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:36,600
The Xiaosheng Society
doesn't want a partner,

67
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:38,040
but the real Buddha Head.

68
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,759
You know where the real Buddha Head is?

69
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:45,040
When I found out
that my master is Zhao Shengge,

70
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:48,600
I guessed where he would hide it.

71
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:49,839
You mean

72
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:53,240
Gu Fengqiu?

73
00:06:53,439 --> 00:06:54,920
Everything started because of her.

74
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,399
Perhaps it's related to her.

75
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:03,399
How do you plan to get me out?

76
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,720
A fake death.

77
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,839
To make Xu Fan stop noticing you.

78
00:07:22,439 --> 00:07:24,879
Xu Fan has put a bounty on my head.

79
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,839
You want to use my head to fool him?

80
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,279
No.

81
00:07:30,439 --> 00:07:32,160
You just need to "die" in front of him.

82
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,040
Then my life

83
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,560
is in your hands.

84
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,319
You do know Xu Fan well,

85
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:52,399
aware that ordinary tricks
can't fool him.

86
00:07:53,199 --> 00:07:56,439
Otherwise, our plan might have failed.

87
00:07:57,439 --> 00:07:58,399
For someone like him,

88
00:07:59,439 --> 00:08:02,079
he will lower his guard
only if you make him think

89
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:04,519
he's really succeeded.

90
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,199
You took the phoenix crown.

91
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:24,680
Will the Xiaosheng Society
get suspicious?

92
00:08:25,879 --> 00:08:28,519
They took the crown's
kingfisher feather phoenix head.

93
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:34,000
I overheard that it seems to be the key
to opening the Jade Buddha Head.

94
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:36,039
What they want is not the relics,

95
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:41,399
but the Feng Mausoleum Treasure Map
hidden inside the Jade Buddha Head.

96
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:43,240
Feng Mausoleum Treasure Map?

97
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:50,600
And I found out the Japanese
are behind the Xiaosheng Society.

98
00:08:52,639 --> 00:08:53,720
If that's the case,

99
00:08:56,399 --> 00:08:58,919
we mustn't let the jade Buddha Head
fall into Japanese hands.

100
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,480
Xu Fan left in a hurry last night.

101
00:09:19,919 --> 00:09:20,720
Could it be...

102
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:24,039
It's Miss Jiang. Go save her.

103
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,559
She has been taken by Xu Fan.

104
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,759
You two, go out first.

105
00:09:50,279 --> 00:09:51,120
Stay back!

106
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,159
Stay back!

107
00:10:04,279 --> 00:10:05,480
I'll blow your head off!

108
00:10:24,679 --> 00:10:25,480
Are you alright?

109
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:29,200
I'm sorry.

110
00:10:29,879 --> 00:10:30,919
I was so useless.

111
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,600
The Jade Buddha Head
was taken by Xu Fan.

112
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:34,879
It's not your fault.

113
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:37,200
We didn't plan thoroughly

114
00:10:37,879 --> 00:10:39,120
and put you in danger.

115
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:42,039
Xu Fan has already gotten
the Jade Buddha Head.

116
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:43,600
So our plan must be moved up.

117
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,639
We'll send you to a safe place first.

118
00:10:45,759 --> 00:10:47,159
Wait for us there to meet up.

119
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:50,360
Then you both much also be careful.

120
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:53,740
Let's go.

121
00:10:54,279 --> 00:10:55,120
Surround this place!

122
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:56,480
Don't let them escape!

123
00:10:56,759 --> 00:10:57,559
Yes!

124
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:02,039
I'll draw them away later.

125
00:11:02,279 --> 00:11:03,360
You look for it.

126
00:11:03,919 --> 00:11:05,679
I know Governor Mansion well.
I'll be fine.

127
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:12,600
Don't move!

128
00:11:18,759 --> 00:11:19,720
Mr. Rong,

129
00:11:22,759 --> 00:11:24,159
where is Xu You'an?

130
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,879
Didn't he die in front of you?

131
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,399
Governor Xu, you're getting old

132
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:32,240
and forgetful.

133
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:56,120
It's fine. With you here, I'm not afraid
we won't get Xu You'an.

134
00:11:57,799 --> 00:12:01,240
Go. Bring Mr. Rong an outfit.

135
00:12:01,279 --> 00:12:02,080
Yes.

136
00:12:03,879 --> 00:12:05,720
Xu You'an won't act impulsively.

137
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,360
He knows what he should do now.

138
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,519
Don't worry.

139
00:12:31,519 --> 00:12:34,159
Xu You'an will definitely
come to save you.

140
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:39,919
Because you are the only family
he has in this world.

141
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:44,759
Eight years ago when you first met,

142
00:12:49,919 --> 00:12:52,360
he was called Shitou.

143
00:12:57,519 --> 00:12:59,159
Hurry, help Mr. Rong get changed.

144
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:04,480
I can't wait to watch this good show.

145
00:13:23,936 --> 00:13:25,216
♪As if it were fate♪

146
00:13:25,216 --> 00:13:26,573
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

147
00:13:27,135 --> 00:13:30,372
♪We miss each other♪

148
00:13:31,616 --> 00:13:33,184
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

149
00:13:33,184 --> 00:13:35,584
♪And a bizarre♪

150
00:13:35,584 --> 00:13:38,386
♪Anonymous legend♪

151
00:13:38,916 --> 00:13:40,928
♪The plot twists and turns♪

152
00:13:41,076 --> 00:13:42,816
♪Play out over and over again♪

153
00:13:42,816 --> 00:13:45,880
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

154
00:13:46,461 --> 00:13:48,160
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

155
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,152
♪Refuse to submit♪

156
00:13:49,152 --> 00:13:52,352
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

157
00:13:54,016 --> 00:13:56,928
♪There are always too many♪

158
00:13:56,928 --> 00:13:58,816
♪Helpless situations♪

159
00:13:58,816 --> 00:14:01,440
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

160
00:14:02,571 --> 00:14:04,531
♪Even if I have questions♪

161
00:14:04,531 --> 00:14:06,531
♪I harbor desires♪

162
00:14:06,531 --> 00:14:09,408
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

163
00:14:09,759 --> 00:14:11,392
♪People come and go♪

164
00:14:11,392 --> 00:14:14,208
♪I'm still all alone♪

165
00:14:14,208 --> 00:14:16,936
♪Wandering around♪

166
00:14:17,184 --> 00:14:20,037
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

167
00:14:20,037 --> 00:14:24,498
♪Go through the entanglement♪

168
00:14:24,864 --> 00:14:26,592
♪If longing♪

169
00:14:26,592 --> 00:14:29,751
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

170
00:14:29,751 --> 00:14:32,506
♪How can I be at ease♪

171
00:14:32,608 --> 00:14:34,922
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

172
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:36,896
♪And travelled around the world♪

173
00:14:36,992 --> 00:14:40,080
♪Scars all over me♪

174
00:14:40,352 --> 00:14:43,264
♪If longing never fades♪

175
00:14:43,264 --> 00:14:44,713
♪Burns still hot♪

176
00:14:44,713 --> 00:14:47,792
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

177
00:14:48,064 --> 00:14:49,921
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

178
00:14:49,984 --> 00:14:51,168
♪In the next life♪

179
00:14:51,168 --> 00:14:55,648
♪Entangle with you again♪
